So Bill, how have you been?

118
00:06:16,310 --> 00:06:16,710
Can't complain.

119
00:06:17,710 --> 00:06:20,730
We have two children who are in college and my business is going well.

120
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:21,910
How about you?

121
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,510
Ah, you know me.

122
00:06:24,030 --> 00:06:25,070
I'm a dedicated bachelor.

123
00:06:25,950 --> 00:06:28,730
I never married, although I do have a beautiful daughter with Mary.

124
00:06:29,170 --> 00:06:29,770
You remember her.

125
00:06:30,250 --> 00:06:31,430
We were high school sweethearts.

126
00:06:32,050 --> 00:06:35,190
It didn't really work out between us, but I really can't complain either.

127
00:06:35,830 --> 00:06:36,370
That's good.

128
00:06:36,950 --> 00:06:37,470
Have you seen Frank?

129
00:06:38,130 --> 00:06:39,150
I was hoping he would come tonight.

130
00:06:39,830 --> 00:06:40,450
You didn't hear?

131
00:06:41,250 --> 00:06:42,890
Frank passed away last year.

132
